      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose looks unsafe and may be a mistake.\n\n**The problem:** Ibuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to **6400 mg/day**.\n- The usual maximum single dose is **800 mg**. This order is twice that.\n- The usual maximum daily dose for adults is **3200 mg/day**. This order is twice that.\n\nDoses this high raise the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury and other toxicity, even in a 70 kg adult with normal kidney and liver function.\n\n**Did you mean one of these?**\n1. **400 mg four times daily** (1600 mg/day). This fits if 1600 mg was meant as the total daily dose.\n2. **800 mg four times daily** (3200 mg/day), which is the maximum daily dose.\n3. **600 mg four times daily** (2400 mg/day), a common dose for pain or inflammation.\n\nTell me which dose you want and I'll enter it right away. If you really do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that and tell me the clinical reason. I'd recommend getting pharmacy to review it before it's given."
      }
