       "type": "text",
       "text": "I entered the order as you confirmed it. The order ID is **ORD-0001**: ibuprofen 1600 mg by mouth, four times daily.\n\nI added a note to the order saying that:\n- 6400 mg/day is twice the usual maximum daily dose, and 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose.\n- You saw the warning and confirmed the dose, but no clinical reason was given.\n- Pharmacist review is requested before it's dispensed.\n\n**Please consider:**\n- **Adding the clinical reason to the order.** This will help pharmacy review it faster.\n- **Monitoring at this dose.** Watch kidney function (creatinine, urine output), signs of GI bleeding (hemoglobin, stool), blood pressure and potassium.\n- **Protecting the stomach,** for example with a proton pump inhibitor, if that fits the patient.\n\nIf this was a typo after all, tell me and I'll help you correct the order."
